# Profiles whose list controls had no <value> entries before
# scripts/check-list-values.pl existed. They are skipped so the check can be
# enabled without a flag day.
#
# Each line is "<profile> <control id>". Removing a line is the goal: the
# correct values are model specific, so they need to come from someone with
# the hardware rather than being copied out of options.xml.in. Copying the
# full enumeration would, for example, advertise all 31 input sources on a
# monitor that has two.
#
# Format: one "<profile> <control>" pair per line, # starts a comment.

